  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "P01",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "none",
      "text": "10月27日，傍晚六点半。距离万圣节还有几天，市中心的大剧院门口已经热闹起来。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P01.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P02",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "none",
      "text": "南瓜灯挂满门廊，紫色射灯映着玻璃墙。戴巫师帽的观众走向入口，一个小女孩举着发光南瓜灯，从人群里跑过。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P02.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P03",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "lin",
      "text": "林夏刚下班，特意绕路来到售票处。他想买一张万圣节演出的票。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P03.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P05",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "窗口里，穿着剧院工装的姑娘正整理票夹。她一抬头，动作忽然停住。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P05.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P07",
      "speaker": "小岚",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "林夏？！",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P07.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P08",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "both",
      "text": "票夹险些从她手里滑下。两人隔着窗口愣了片刻，随后一起笑了。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P08.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P10",
      "speaker": "小岚",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "我在这儿上班啊，票务！你呢，来看演出？",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P10.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P12",
      "speaker": "小岚",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "毕业以后就没见过了吧。你怎么还是这副样子。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P12.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P13",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "both",
      "text": "林夏拿出钱，小岚却把他的手轻轻挡了回去。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P13.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P14",
      "speaker": "小岚",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "别买了。我这儿有员工内部票，每个员工每月两张福利票，我这月的还没用。送你。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P14.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P15",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "ticket",
      "text": "她从票夹里抽出一张硬卡纸门票，隔着窗口递来。金边在灯下微微发亮。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P15.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P16",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "ticket",
      "text": "票面写着《南瓜夜·尖叫音乐会》、10月31日19:30、VIP A区3排。右下角还有一行小字：员工内部赠票，不对外销售。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P16.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P18",
      "speaker": "小岚",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "老同学，客气什么。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P18.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P20",
      "speaker": "小岚",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "你写这块，我空了加你！",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P20.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P21",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "note",
      "text": "林夏低头在便签上写下联系方式。纸的开头是“159……”，余下的号码被他手掌挡住。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P21.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P22",
      "speaker": "售票处同事（画外）",
      "focus": "none",
      "text": "小岚！你过来一下！",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
      "rate": "+6%",
      "pitch": "+4Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P22.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P23",
      "speaker": "小岚",
      "focus": "lan",
      "text": "马上！你写完放这就好！",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P23.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    },
    {
      "key": "P25",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "focus": "none",
      "text": "林夏走出剧院。写着联系方式的便签，还留在售票处的窗口里。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "audio": "public/voice/prologue/P25.mp3",
      "audio_ready": false
    }
  ]
}
